                <pb facs="1237" n="1227" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg1227"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.911/7–1349: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Cabot</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-07-13T19:00:00-04:00">July 13, 1949—7 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1401. Urtel 2740. Dept believes time opportune to give publicity Miner as well as
                    similar cases where violence condoned by authorities. Dept would prefer take
                    occasion lodging of joint consular protest for this action. If joint protest
                    unlikely or delayed please inform, in which case Dept will immediately proceed
                    publicity these cases.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
